<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import prices, CPI.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import prices, CPI.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Producer prices   June	   +0.2 pct m/m	   July 21</p>
<p> Import prices     June	   +0.5 pct m/m	   July 25/28</p>
<p> Prelim. WG CPI    July	   +1.7 pct y/y	   July 25/28</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
